<title>NORWAY: Norway labour market mediators seek to avert strike.</title>
<headline>Norway labour market mediators seek to avert strike.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian state mediators sought on Sunday to solve deadlocked nationwide wage talks between labour and management to avert a strike by 250,000 workers.</p>
<p>Mediator Reidar Webster had until midnight/2200 GMT to iron out outstanding issues in the main round of talks after initial negotiations collapsed on March 19. Mediation began last week.</p>
</text>
